    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok so you say the consensus leans toward \"genuine strategic integration\"... but is there actually data showing that these programs provide a tangible boost to profitability? or is it more just that they prevent legal or reputation issues? i'm seeing a lot of conflicting reports on whether there's a real ROI vs just being a \"check the box\" thing for HR.",
